          "width": 242,
          "height": 412
        },
        "pageimage": "TheFemaleMan(1stEd).jpg",
        "extract": "The Female Man is a feminist science fiction novel by American writer Joanna Russ. It was originally written in 1970 and first published in 1975 by Bantam Books. Russ was an ardent feminist and challenged sexist views during the 1970s with her novels, short stories, and nonfiction works. These works include We Who Are About To..., \"When It Changed\", and What Are We Fighting For?: Sex, Race, Class, and the Future of Feminism.\nThe novel follows the lives of four women living in parallel universes which differ in time and place. The women visit each other's worlds and are startled by the different views on gender roles and social conventions surrounding...",
